[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786288770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-2786288770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":2786288770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mE2SC","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T12:33:14Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T12:33:14Z","body":"The side effect is that the results of `texure.get_size()` and `texture.get_image().get_size()` may be different. `texture.get_image()` will return the actual size of the internal image data.\r\n\r\nI found it does not work in TileSet and TileMap. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786288770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786295649","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-2786295649","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":2786295649,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mE39h","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T12:35:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T12:35:48Z","body":"I think this PR calls the new import parameter \"Resolution scale\". I prefer this name over the one that I suggested in my proposal. Thanks!!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786295649/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786495952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-2786495952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":2786495952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mFo3Q","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T13:45:41Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T01:16:44Z","body":"For me \"resolution scale\" seems to better match the quality control behavior, but I'm willing to hear others' suggestions.\r\n\r\nI briefly viewed the code of TileSet, I don't think it can be fixed easily. It relies on image processing, and it seems pointless to re-upscale the image after downscaled by the resolution scale. Maybe we can add a warning for this option to indicate it can't used in TileSet.\r\n \r\nTested https://github.com/beicause/tps-demo/tree/4.5-tex-resolution-scale (all texture are imported with resolution scale and basis universal) Currently this seems to work well both in 2D and 3D, but I'm not sure if there are any other causes that it doesn't work.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786495952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801477313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-2801477313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":2801477313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m-ybB","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-14T12:00:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-14T16:40:02Z","body":"I made `CompressedTexture2D.get_image` to return an image that resized to original size. This should resolve all the side effects (except `RenderingServer.texture_2d_get`), though it has a performance impact on `get_image`. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2801477313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133143663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3133143663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3133143663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66v_pv","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T15:59:11Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T17:48:02Z","body":"**EDIT:** I've created a bug report for this issue that affects both this PR and also the existing Size Limit import parameter: #109092\r\n\r\nI've noticed that when using the Resolution scale, the scaling has a bias towards the top left corner of the texture so that the bottom and right edges of the texture get cut off:\r\n\r\nResolution Scale | SVG Scale\r\n-- | --\r\n<img width=\"571\" height=\"795\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f44be28e-5ae2-4227-8792-967bc51ba487\" /> | <img width=\"788\" height=\"844\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cddcf01e-2712-4374-ba4a-9573c61f79a2\" />\r\n\r\nI would expect both of these approaches to produce the same exact same texture in GPU memory, except that they should produce different size properties that are used for rendering and scripting.\r\n\r\nThat said, this problem also happens with the existing Size Limit feature, so this is probably an existing bug unrelated to this PR :(\r\n\r\nOriginal | Resolution Scale | Size Limit\r\n-- | -- | --\r\n<img width=\"1260\" height=\"773\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d7e1a9eb-dc40-4249-a6c3-4fa81a96d9a1\" /> | <img width=\"1331\" height=\"774\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97e38ca0-ca88-47a5-a434-d08f854bcaa2\" /> | <img width=\"1873\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9078b6c7-8ee7-4a9c-ad3f-2ecd4cdfdee8\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133143663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133201214","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3133201214","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3133201214,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66wNs-","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T16:15:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T16:15:26Z","body":"I see that the memory usage is updated, but the number of mipmaps and resolution is not updated:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"427\" height=\"260\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96db0234-08cf-46a7-a317-5e238e5f139c\" />\r\n\r\nI propose that when the Resolution Scale is used, the mipmaps should be updated and both the \"size\" and texture resolution should be presented in this view:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"419\" height=\"248\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d2afb4b-bdc2-461c-870e-44533d029a16\" />","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133201214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133381750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3133381750","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3133381750,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66w5x2","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}",