> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"427\" height=\"260\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/17506573/472086475-96db0234-08cf-46a7-a317-5e238e5f139c.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..vic49_qF33W6suSHIU2k0NpXPSLMgfLdSjg9km12NsE\">\r\n> I propose that when the Resolution Scale is used, the mipmaps should be updated and both the \"size\" and texture resolution should be presented in this view:\r\n> \r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"419\" height=\"248\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/17506573/472091450-3d2afb4b-bdc2-461c-870e-44533d029a16.png?jwt=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..Lz5NFTqwJ_bDMoZlvanOg3ucsZB_pksfkYMq-woOJJs\">\r\n\r\nFixed mipmaps count and implemented the proposal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3133558137/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136823025","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3136823025","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3136823025,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66-B7x","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T15:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T15:23:26Z","body":"> Fixed mipmaps count and implemented the proposal.\r\n\r\nThanks! This looks good to me; we'll see what other people think and if it is usable to the typical user...\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136823025/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140187722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3140187722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3140187722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67K3ZK","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T14:23:41Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T14:23:41Z","body":"I haven't done any performance testing on this feature yet. @beicause have you? It would be good to see some stats for projects with a large number of textures.\r\n\r\nFor example, if a game is developed for PC and ported to mobile, there might be hundreds of textures that are set to a 50% resolution scale for the mobile branch. How would setting this resolution scale affect import performance?\r\n\r\nAdditionally, maybe there is a way to implement this that takes advantage of mipmaps(???) For example, maybe only resolution scales of 0.5, 0.25, 0.125, 0.0625, 0.03125 could be allowed to greatly improve import speed(???) I really don't know about how texture importing is implemented, so I'm not sure what approach(es) can be used to ensure good performance of this new feature.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3140187722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141904614","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3141904614","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3141904614,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67Rajm","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T01:57:48Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T01:57:48Z","body":">I haven't done any performance testing on this feature yet. @beicause have you? It would be good to see some stats for projects with a large number of textures.\r\n\r\nNo. But I made a branch for tps-demo https://github.com/beicause/tps-demo/tree/4.5-tex-resolution-scale (I used text editor to search and replace all `process/resolution_scale`). Import should be faster with a lower `resolution_scale`.\r\n\r\n>Additionally, maybe there is a way to implement this that takes advantage of mipmaps(???) For example, maybe only resolution scales of 0.5, 0.25, 0.125, 0.0625, 0.03125 could be allowed to greatly improve import speed(???) I really don't know about how texture importing is implemented, so I'm not sure what approach(es) can be used to ensure good performance of this new feature.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what this means. This doesn't seem to be related to mipmaps.\r\n\r\nIdeally we should implement import overrides similar to the proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10034, allowing different [feature tags](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/export/feature_tags.html) to create overrides and generate platform variants simultaneously. This way, we wouldn’t need to replace `resolution_scale` for testing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141904614/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141932388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105139#issuecomment-3141932388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105139","id":3141932388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67RhVk","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T02:15:56Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T02:15:56Z","body":"> No. But I made a branch for tps-demo https://github.com/beicause/tps-demo/tree/4.5-tex-resolution-scale (I used text editor to search and replace all `process/resolution_scale`). Import should be faster with a lower `resolution_scale`.\n\nGood to hear. It would be good to see what the import time for a large project is with textures set to a resolution scale of `0.5` and a resolution scale of `1.0`. I might be able to test this at some point in the future, but anyone else is welcome to before then.\n\n> I'm not sure what this means. This doesn't seem to be related to mipmaps.\n\nOk, then please disregard :) I thought there might be an optimization opportunity to reuse mipmaps for the purpose of resolution scale (so the resampling only needs to happen for mipmaps and would be reused for resolution scale). But if this doesn't make sense, that's entirely fine; it was just an idea that came to mind.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141932388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]